  "title": "Chicken, Cheese, and Biscuits",
  "description": "A melange of Cheddar, chicken, mushrooms and green beans is capped with flaky buttermilk biscuits for a yummy all-in-one meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Jill M."
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-05-11T13:56:20-04:00",
